{
  "version": "2",
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "title_main_001",
      "text": "Git 内部原理",
      "segment_type": "title_main"
    },
    {
      "id": "title_sub_001",
      "text": "一次 commit 背后发生了什么",
      "segment_type": "title_sub"
    },
    {
      "id": "hook_001",
      "text": "你每天都在敲 git commit。但回车按下去的那一刻，Git 到底做了什么？",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "section_context": "开场",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "obj_header_001",
      "text": "一切皆是对象",
      "segment_type": "section_header",
      "section_context": "一切皆是对象",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "obj_intro_001",
      "text": "Git 的仓库，本质上是一个对象数据库。它只有三种核心对象。",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "section_context": "一切皆是对象",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "obj_blob_001",
      "text": "blob，只存文件的内容。",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "section_context": "一切皆是对象",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "obj_tree_001",
      "text": "tree，存目录结构和文件名。",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "section_context": "一切皆是对象",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "obj_commit_001",
      "text": "commit，把一次快照打包，记下作者和时间。",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "section_context": "一切皆是对象",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "chain_header_001",
      "text": "提交链成历史",
      "segment_type": "section_header",
      "section_context": "提交链成历史",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "chain_intro_001",
      "text": "每个 commit，都记着上一个 commit 的编号。这个编号叫哈希，是内容的指纹。",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "section_context": "提交链成历史",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "chain_demo_001",
      "text": "我们看一眼真实的仓库。",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "section_context": "提交链成历史",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "chain_cmd_001",
      "text": "$ git log --oneline",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "section_context": "提交链成历史",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "chain_cmd_002",
      "text": "$ git show HEAD",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "section_context": "提交链成历史",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "branch_header_001",
      "text": "分支只是个指针",
      "segment_type": "section_header",
      "section_context": "分支只是个指针",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "branch_intro_001",
      "text": "所谓分支，其实只是一个 41 字节的文件。里面只有一行字：它指向哪个 commit。",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "section_context": "分支只是个指针",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "branch_head_001",
      "text": "ref: refs/heads/main",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "section_context": "分支只是个指针",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "branch_new_001",
      "text": "创建一个新分支，就是放进一张新纸条，不到一毫秒。",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "section_context": "分支只是个指针",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "end_001",
      "text": "所以，commit 不是改动的集合，而是一个带指针的快照。",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "section_context": "结尾",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "end_002",
      "text": "理解了这一点，rebase 和 reset 就都不神秘了。",
      "segment_type": "content",
      "section_context": "结尾",
      "audio_request": {
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural"
      }
    }
  ],
